<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    ToolUp.Remoting.Benchmarks (Phase 804.C, closing 69k.G).

    Generated versus reflection, on the two paths the generator emits for:
    the client's binary-response DECODE (closed-algebra decoder vs the
    reflection reader) and the server's DISPATCH of a request (typed
    argument parse + direct handler call + serialise, vs the reflective
    proxy). Cold start is measured in a fresh process per arm; per-request
    latency in a warm loop. Numbers are recorded in
    docs/migrations/69k-source-generator-dispatcher.md.

    Stopwatch, not BenchmarkDotNet, deliberately: the question is an
    order-of-magnitude one (does the generated path move the request cost
    at all, against a measured 0.36 ms hot path), the harness must run in
    seconds inside a dev loop, and the repository takes no benchmark
    dependency for a number it reads once per phase. Same shape as
    dev-scripts/perf-budget-gate.ps1: min over rounds, median beside it.

    The subject is the AOT sample's contract and its GENERATED modules,
    compiled in by link so the benchmark measures exactly the source the
    sample ships rather than a second emission of it.
-->
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
        <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
        <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
        <RootNamespace>ToolUp.Remoting.Benchmarks</RootNamespace>
        <!-- The subject's argument table rides the reflection converter set;
             the sample makes the same choice, for the same reason. -->
        <JsonSerializerIsReflectionEnabledByDefault>true</JsonSerializerIsReflectionEnabledByDefault>
    </PropertyGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
        <Compile Include="..\..\samples\HelloWorld-AOT\HelloWorld.AOT\Generated\CorpusDecoders.fs" Link="Generated\CorpusDecoders.fs" />
        <Compile Include="..\..\samples\HelloWorld-AOT\HelloWorld.AOT\Generated\CorpusApiDispatch.fs" Link="Generated\CorpusApiDispatch.fs" />
        <Compile Include="Program.fs" />
    </ItemGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
        <ProjectReference Include="..\..\samples\HelloWorld-AOT\HelloWorld.AOT.Contract\HelloWorld.AOT.Contract.fsproj" />
        <ProjectReference Include="..\ToolUp.Platform.Core\ToolUp.Platform.Core.fsproj" />
        <ProjectReference Include="..\ToolUp.Platform.Server\ToolUp.Platform.Server.fsproj" />
    </ItemGroup>
    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="FSharp.Core" />
    </ItemGroup>
</Project>
